---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Prepare - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Prepare Before You Arrive</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600  ">
      Essential steps to complete before landing in China — visa, documents, apps, and first-72-hours planning.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Visa & Entry Rules</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          Check if you qualify for visa-free entry. Most passport holders need a tourist (L) visa in advance.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Entry Documents Checklist</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          Passport, visa, arrival card, hotel bookings, and return ticket — what you actually need to show.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">First 72 Hours Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          What to do immediately after landing: SIM card, WeChat Pay, subway card, and internet access.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Safety & Emergency Prep</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          Police, ambulance, and embassy numbers to save before you fly. China is safe, but preparation helps.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>